WEBVTT

00:10:27.556 --> 00:10:30.396
who will tell you that gray
is not a great color

00:10:30.396 --> 00:10:32.516
if you're trying to encourage creativity.

00:10:32.556 --> 00:10:33.796
We know that nature,

00:10:34.956 --> 00:10:36.196
the unexpected

00:10:37.396 --> 00:10:41.756
and even messiness
can help induce divergent thinking.

00:10:43.036 --> 00:10:48.276
So as we build our metaverse workplaces,
we can be inspired by our imaginations

00:10:48.276 --> 00:10:50.796
but guided by all
of this fantastic research

00:10:50.836 --> 00:10:52.316
that's been done before.

00:10:52.316 --> 00:10:56.396
Lots of people ask me how far
we are away from a true metaverse,

00:10:56.396 --> 00:10:59.356
and I don’t really have
an answer for that.

00:10:59.356 --> 00:11:01.916
Or I do, but we’d be here all day.